  "system": {
    "slug": "atlas-mech",
    "details": {
      "level": {
        "value": 9
      },
      "publicNotes": "<p>The Atlas is a large piloted combat walker deployed by Cerberus as heavy fire support. It combines a powerful missile launcher and heavy cannon with thick composite armor. An Atlas Mech is a serious threat requiring coordinated team effort to destroy. When the Atlas is reduced to 0 HP, the pilot may eject and continue fighting as a Cerberus Centurion.</p><p><strong>Construct Immunities:</strong> Immune to disease, mental effects, poison, sleep, and paralysis.</p><p><strong>Pilot Ejection:</strong> When the Atlas Mech reaches 0 HP, the pilot ejects and acts on the next initiative count as a Cerberus Centurion (Level 4) with half HP.</p><p><strong>Missile Barrage (2 actions):</strong> Fires missiles at up to 2 targets within 120 feet. Each target takes 3d10+8 piercing damage (DC 27 Reflex for half). Recharge 1d4 rounds.</p>",
      "privateNotes": "",
